{"seq":1,"slug":"loose-octree-lod","title":"松散八叉树与 LOD：解决大对象的空间管理难题","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-spatial-data-structures/advanced-techniques/loose-octree-lod","wordCount":1614,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"松散八叉树与-lod-解决大对象的空间管理难题\">松散八叉树与 LOD：解决大对象的空间管理难题</h1><p>标准八叉树在处理大型对象时存在一个令人头疼的根本问题：当一个对象横跨节点边界时，它要么被强制放入根节点（完全失去空间局部性），要么被分裂后存入多个节点（引入复杂的去重逻辑）。**松散八叉树（Loose Octree）**通过将每个节点的边界扩大一个固定倍数，巧妙地解决了这个问题，同时还天然地与 **LOD（Level of Detail）**系统集成，是开放世界游戏场景管理的核心技术之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>松散区域（Loose Region）</strong>：节点边界按膨胀因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>（通常 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k=2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>）扩大，使直径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d \\leq L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 的对象必然有唯一存储节点</li>\n<li><strong>严格区域（Strict Region）</strong>：节点的逻辑归属区间，对象中心点决定它属于哪个子节点</li>\n<li><strong>LOD 与树深度对应</strong>：树的每一层天然对应一个 LOD 级别，距摄像机越远使用越高层的粗糙模型</li>\n<li><strong>小位移不触发更新</strong>：对象在松散区域内小幅移动时无需修改树结构，减少每帧维护代价</li>\n<li><strong>查询需访问祖先层</strong>：松散区域扩大后，父节点可能存储能覆盖查询点的对象，遍历时需检测所有祖先</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"标准八叉树的大对象问题\">标准八叉树的大对象问题</h2><p>回顾标准八叉树：每个节点管理精确的立方体区域。当对象的包围球半径大于节点边长的一半时，它必然横跨多个子节点：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;标准八叉树\\n节点边长 L&quot;] --&gt; B{对象大小}&#10;    B --&gt; |&quot;对象半径 &gt; L/2\\n横跨节点边界&quot;| C[&quot;被迫放入父节点\\n跳过精细层级&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; |&quot;对象半径 &lt; L/2&quot;| D[&quot;正常放入叶节点\\n精确定位&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;父节点积累大量大对象\\n退化为近线性查询&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"标准八叉树\\n节点边长 L\"] --&gt; B{对象大小}\n    B --&gt; |\"对象半径 &gt; L/2\\n横跨节点边界\"| C[\"被迫放入父节点\\n跳过精细层级\"]\n    B --&gt; |\"对象半径 &lt; L/2\"| D[\"正常放入叶节点\\n精确定位\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"父节点积累大量大对象\\n退化为近线性查询\"]</pre><p>在真实游戏场景中，大对象（建筑、车辆、BOSS 怪物）往往正好在边界处，这不是运气不好，而是统计必然——对象尺寸跨越多个数量级时，总有相当比例的对象处于「比当前节点大但比父节点小」的尴尬位置。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"松散八叉树的核心思想\">松散八叉树的核心思想</h2><p>松散八叉树为每个节点的边界增加一个<strong>膨胀因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></strong>（通常 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k = 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>，即边长翻倍）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>严格区域（Strict Region）</strong>：节点的精确立方体，边长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>，决定对象归属哪个节点</li>\n<li><strong>松散区域（Loose Region）</strong>：节点的扩展立方体，边长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k \\cdot L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>，节点实际管理的空间</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"节点层级  严格边长  松散边长（k=2）&#10;  0       256m      512m&#10;  1       128m      256m&#10;  2        64m      128m&#10;  3        32m       64m\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>节点层级  严格边长  松散边长（k=2）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  0       256m      512m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  1       128m      256m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  2        64m      128m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  3        32m       64m</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>对象插入规则</strong>：对象根据其中心点的<strong>严格区域</strong>决定归属节点，但它存储在使得其包围球<strong>完全在松散区域内</strong>的最深节点中。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"膨胀因子与对象尺寸的关系\">膨胀因子与对象尺寸的关系</h2><p>对于膨胀因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k = 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>，任何对象只要其直径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d \\leq L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>（严格边长），就一定能被某个层级的松散区域完全包含：</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：直径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d \\leq L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 的对象，其中心在某个严格区域内，该区域的松散边界比严格边界向外扩展了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span>，而对象的最大半径恰好是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span>，所以对象必然在松散区域内。</p>\n<p>这意味着：每个对象都能找到一个<strong>唯一的</strong>存储节点，而不需要跨节点分割。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;对象直径 d&quot;] --&gt; B{vs 节点严格边长 L}&#10;    B --&gt; |&quot;d ≤ L\\n满足松散条件&quot;| C[&quot;存入该层节点\\n松散区域恰好包含对象&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; |&quot;d &gt; L\\n不满足&quot;| D[&quot;尝试父节点\\n父节点 L&#39; = 2L\\n检验 d ≤ L&#39;&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"对象直径 d\"] --&gt; B{vs 节点严格边长 L}\n    B --&gt; |\"d ≤ L\\n满足松散条件\"| C[\"存入该层节点\\n松散区域恰好包含对象\"]\n    B --&gt; |\"d &gt; L\\n不满足\"| D[\"尝试父节点\\n父节点 L' = 2L\\n检验 d ≤ L'\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"实现-松散八叉树节点\">实现：松散八叉树节点</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"struct LooseOctreeNode {&#10;    // 严格区域的中心和边长（用于确定子节点归属）&#10;    Vec3  strictCenter;&#10;    float strictHalfSize;  // 严格边长的一半&#10;&#10;    // 松散区域边长 = k * strictHalfSize * 2&#10;    // 默认 k=2 时，looseHalfSize = strictHalfSize * k = 2 * strictHalfSize&#10;    float looseHalfSize() const { return strictHalfSize * 2.0f; }&#10;&#10;    std::vector&lt;int&gt; objects;  // 存储的对象（完全在松散区域内）&#10;    LooseOctreeNode*  children[8];&#10;&#10;    // 确定对象应放入哪个子节点（按严格区域）&#10;    int getChildIndex(const Vec3&amp; objCenter) const {&#10;        return ((objCenter.x &gt; strictCenter.x) ? 4 : 0) |&#10;               ((objCenter.y &gt; strictCenter.y) ? 2 : 0) |&#10;               ((objCenter.z &gt; strictCenter.z) ? 1 : 0);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    void insert(int objId, const BoundingSphere&amp; objSphere, int depth) {&#10;        if (depth &gt;= MAX_DEPTH) {&#10;            objects.push_back(objId);&#10;            return;&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        // 找目标子节点&#10;        int childIdx = getChildIndex(objSphere.center);&#10;        LooseOctreeNode* child = getOrCreateChild(childIdx);&#10;&#10;        // 检查对象是否完全在子节点的松散区域内&#10;        if (child-&gt;looseContains(objSphere)) {&#10;            child-&gt;insert(objId, objSphere, depth + 1);&#10;        } else {&#10;            // 对象在子节点的松散区域之外，存入当前节点&#10;            objects.push_back(objId);&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    bool looseContains(const BoundingSphere&amp; sphere) const {&#10;        float lhs = looseHalfSize();&#10;        return fabs(sphere.center.x - strictCenter.x) + sphere.radius &lt;= lhs &amp;&amp;&#10;               fabs(sphere.center.y - strictCenter.y) + sphere.radius &lt;= lhs &amp;&amp;&#10;               fabs(sphere.center.z - strictCenter.z) + sphere.radius &lt;= lhs;&#10;    }&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LooseOctreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 严格区域的中心和边长（用于确定子节点归属）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Vec3  strictCenter;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> strictHalfSize;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 严格边长的一半</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 松散区域边长 = k * strictHalfSize * 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 默认 k=2 时，looseHalfSize = strictHalfSize * k = 2 * strictHalfSize</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> looseHalfSize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> strictHalfSize </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::vector</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;int></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> objects;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 存储的对象（完全在松散区域内）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    LooseOctreeNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  children[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki