eAABB</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">())) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 计算本层级的 LOD</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> distToCamera </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> distance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cameraPos, node->strictCenter);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lodLevel </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> computeLOD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(distToCamera, currentDepth);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> objId : node->objects) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        renderObject</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(objId, lodLevel);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 递归子节点（更精细的 LOD）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">node-></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isLeaf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (node->children[i]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">                renderWithLOD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(node->children[i], cameraPos,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                               currentDepth </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, culler);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"动态对象更新\">动态对象更新</h2><p>松散八叉树的对象更新流程：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant O as 对象&#10;    participant N as 当前节点&#10;    participant T as 松散八叉树&#10;&#10;    O-&gt;&gt;N: 位置更新通知&#10;    N-&gt;&gt;N: 检查对象是否仍在松散区域内&#10;    alt 仍在松散区域内&#10;        N-&gt;&gt;N: 保持不变(利用膨胀容纳小位移)&#10;    else 移出松散区域&#10;        N-&gt;&gt;T: 从当前节点删除&#10;        T-&gt;&gt;T: 从根节点重新插入对象&#10;    end\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant O as 对象\n    participant N as 当前节点\n    participant T as 松散八叉树\n\n    O-&gt;&gt;N: 位置更新通知\n    N-&gt;&gt;N: 检查对象是否仍在松散区域内\n    alt 仍在松散区域内\n        N-&gt;&gt;N: 保持不变(利用膨胀容纳小位移)\n    else 移出松散区域\n        N-&gt;&gt;T: 从当前节点删除\n        T-&gt;&gt;T: 从根节点重新插入对象\n    end</pre><p><strong>关键优化</strong>：松散区域的膨胀使得小幅移动不需要更新树结构，因为对象仍在膨胀后的范围内。这与 BVH 中的 Fat AABB 思想相同，减少了更新频率。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"与标准八叉树的对比\">与标准八叉树的对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>标准八叉树</th>\n<th>松散八叉树（k=2）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>大对象处理</td>\n<td>被迫放入高层节点</td>\n<td>根据尺寸选择合适层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每对象只存一份</td>\n<td>是（但可能在高层）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询需访问祖先节点</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是（轻微开销增加）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存利用率</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中（松散区域重叠）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对象移动更新频率</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低（膨胀容纳小位移）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LOD 集成</td>\n<td>需要额外层级映射</td>\n<td>天然对应</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"实际应用-unreal-engine-场景管理\">实际应用：Unreal Engine 场景管理</h2><p>Unreal Engine 的 World Partition 系统和传统的 World Composition 系统均借鉴了松散八叉树的思想：大型场景被划分为层次化的加载单元（Streaming Level），每个单元有严格的逻辑边界和更宽松的实际内容范围，允许大型对象（如大型建筑）跨越逻辑边界而不被强制分割。</p>\n<p>在实际项目落地时需关注以下要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>膨胀因子选择</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k=2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 是理论最小值（保证唯一存储），实践中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k=1.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span></span></span></span></span> 可降低重叠但部分大对象仍需上移</li>\n<li><strong>最大深度设置</strong>：通常 6-10 层，过深会使内存占用呈指数增长（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>8</mn><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8^d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 最多节点数）</li>\n<li><strong>LOD 切换迟滞</strong>：在层级边界引入迟滞区间（如 ±10% 边长）避免频繁 LOD 切换导致视觉抖动</li>\n</ul>\n<p>松散八叉树是本章其他高级结构的起点。当需要处理大规模<strong>静态</strong>数据时，R-Tree 和 KD-Tree 提供了不同的优化路径，参见 <a href=\"r-tree-kd-tree\">R-Tree 与 KD-Tree</a>。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>松散八叉树用膨胀因子（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k=2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>）解决了标准八叉树对大对象无法精确分层的根本缺陷，保证每个对象有唯一的存储节点且代价为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。LOD 天然与树的深度对应，距摄像机的距离决定访问哪一层。动态更新时，松散区域容纳小幅移动，减少树的修改频率。代价是查询时需要检测所有祖先节点的对象（轻微性能开销），以及松散区域重叠导致的少量冗余遍历。与标准八叉树相比，松散变体是大型开放世界场景管理的更优选择，Unreal Engine 的 World Partition 系统正是其工程实践。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"松散八叉树与 LOD：解决大对象的空间管理难题","id":"松散八叉树与-lod-解决大对象的空间管理难题"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"标准八叉树的大对象问题","id":"标准八叉树的大对象问题"},{"level":2,"text":"松散八叉树的核心思想","id":"松散八叉树的核心思想"},{"level":2,"text":"膨胀因子与对象尺寸的关系","id":"膨胀因子与对象尺寸的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"实现：松散八叉树节点","id":"实现-松散八叉树节点"},{"level":2,"text":"查询：松散区域的影响","id":"查询-松散区域的影响"},{"level":2,"text":"LOD 集成：层次化细节管理","id":"lod-集成-层次化细节管理"},{"level":3,"text":"基于距离的 LOD 判定","id":"基于距离的-lod-判定"},{"level":2,"text":"动态对象更新","id":"动态对象更新"},{"level":2,"text":"与标准八叉树的对比","id":"与标准八叉树的对比"},{"level":2,"text":"实际应用：Unreal Engine 场景管理","id":"实际应用-unreal-engine-场景管理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"范围查询与最近邻：游戏 AI、物理与音效的空间感知基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-spatial-data-structures/query-culling/range-nearest-queries"},"next":{"title":"R-Tree 与 KD-Tree：大规模静态空间数据的专用索引","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-spatial-data-structures/advanced-techniques/r-tree-kd-tree"}}